notes.body:
@moshekaplan @AndersBroman 

Note that if speed is a concern, this job can also be run in parallel with other jobs, so wouldn't make the total pipeline much longer.

GitLab also has [scheduled pipelines](https://docs.gitlab.com/ee/ci/pipelines/schedules.html) that could be used to run the jobs periodically, rather than on every commit, as well. We have some users that set up their security scans to run nightly/weekly/etc rather than as part of every MR.
